    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tum eorum, quae in eadem asseruntur, falsitalem convin- cunt ipsius Zosimi epistolae 5 et 6, « datae iii kal.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "« Octobris Honorio aug. xi et Constantio ii conss., » in quarum prima Zosimus vehementer indignatur adversus Proculum Massiliensem,",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quod et ipse in synodo Taurinensi subripiendum id putavit, ut haec synodus sibi praestaret ordinandorum in Narbonensi secunda provincia sacerdotum potestatem,",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et « so- cium sibi Simplicium Viennensis civitatis ascivit, qui non dissimili impudentia postularet, ut sibi quoque creandorum sacerdotum permitteretur arbi- trium.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "» Deinde ut id jus « inviolabili in utraque Narbonensi et Viennensi auctoritate possideat me- tropolitanus Arelatensis civitatis episcopus, » con- stituit; quod et epist. 6 confirmat.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
