    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Suspicionem hujusmodi tam a vero abhor- rentem admitti prorsus non sinunt ejusdem pontificis epistolae 10 et 11,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Martii 5 die anni 418 consigna- tae, ex quibus eum in praedicta sententia constan- tem fuisse exploratum est.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.1.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Eo autem firmiora sunt ista falsitalis epistolae hujus argumenta, quod ejus artifex litterarum Zosimi in Arelatensis episcopi gratiam scriptarum veritatem agnoscat ipse, ac pro certo habeat.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ut viciniores intra provinciam civitates, donec res ple- nius excutiatur, sibi vindicet. Lazarum damnatum esse.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Zosimus episcopus Simplicio Viennensi archi- episcopo salutem.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Revelatum nobis est, qualiter in Taurinensi syn- odo causas tuae dioeceseos prosecutus fueris.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et licet Arelatensi episcopo, antequam legatus tuus venisset, propter reverentiam sancti Trophimi, jus et pontificium super tres provincias habere scrip- serimus :",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "tamen si ita est, ut scripta tua nobis missa continent, interim usque dum lucidius venti- letur, potestatem antiquam tibi manere permitti- mus :",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop#PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-zosimus/pl20_16_epistolas.zosimop",
    "canonical_ref": "PL20.EPISTOLAS.2.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut sicut in Taurinensi gravissimorum episco- porum synodo, pacis consilio decretum est, vici- niores tibi intra provinciam civitates vindices, do- nec plenius rei ordinem charitas apostolica prose- quatur.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
